# Rust tests

Always use `cargo nextest`. Never `cargo test` for running the suite.

Do not pass `--test-threads=1` or any other thread cap. Let nextest use its default parallelism.

```bash
# good
cargo nextest run --locked
cargo nextest run --locked --profile ci

# bad
cargo test
cargo test -- --test-threads=1
cargo nextest run --test-threads=1
```
